    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d296">

                <pb facs="0522" n="506" sameAs="frus:frus1950v02/pg506"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–850: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-12-08T19:23:00-05:00">December 8,
                            1950—7:23 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Delga 392.… South West Africa. Delegation
                    reviewed position US should take in plenary. It was agreed we should seek defeat
                    resolution recommended by Committee 4 (US/A/C.4/201) and offer substitute resolution (US/A/C.4/202).<anchor n="1" xml:id="d296-f1"/> Point was made Union
                    would like nothing better than adoption Committee 4 resolution which would give
                    it excuse to do nothing, whereas substitute resolution gave promise of concrete
                    results and appeared to have reasonable chance of obtaining required two-thirds
                    majority following defeat of committee resolution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d296-f1" n="1" xml:id="d296-f1-content">
                <p>For Doc. US/A/C.4/201, see <ref target="#pg503">p.
                        503</ref>. Doc. US/A/C.4/202 is not printed;
                    for the later and final text of the substitute resolution, see <ref
                        target="#pg507">p. 507</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
